This is the web console of ESP-KVM (https://github.com/espkvm/espkvm), which
builds on the p4kvm project by Jonathan Rowny (https://github.com/jrowny/p4kvm),
also under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The interface icons in src/components/Icon.vue were drawn for this project
following the conventions of the Feather and Lucide icon sets - a 24x24 box, 2px
strokes, round caps and joins. Drawn to those conventions, several shapes came
out close to theirs, and are acknowledged here rather than pretended away:
